    {
      "id": "comment-170adba5-5c5b-4b9c-b9e9-5f7cefe32436",
      "type": "COMMENT",
      "name": "Welcome",
      "position": [
        50,
        50
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "# Token Prediction - How LLMs \"Think\"\n\nLanguage models predict the next token. Let's see how!\n\n## To Do and Notice\n\n1. **Context**: Previous tokens influence prediction\n2. **Probability distribution**: Each token has a likelihood\n3. **Sampling**: How we pick from the distribution\n\n## The Core Loop\n\n```\nfor each position:\n    context = previous_tokens\n    logits = model(context)\n    probs = softmax(logits)\n    next_token = sample(probs)\n```\n\nThis is happening billions of times in ChatGPT!\n\n**Challenge**: How does context length affect predictions?",
        "width": 450,
        "show_on_start": true
      },
      "inputs": {},
      "outputs": {},
      "weights": {},
      "collapsed": false,
      "color": "#5c4a3d",
      "tags": [],
      "description": "Tutorial introduction"
    }
  ],
